        "Description": "Further investigation shows that one of the leaders is heading to a goverment data center in Chongqing, China. He is planning to enter as a safety inspector in discuise, then meet his two secret internal cult members to discuss a plan.\r\rThis data center is the main data procesing point for a large amount of hosptials in the region of Chongqing.\r\rThe secret members are planning to hack &amp; destroy all data, causing a massive hosptial outage and potential mass casualties. Do not let that happen.",
